---
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
import { SOCIOS, EMAIL_ESTUDIO } from '../lib/whatsapp';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container site-footer__grid">
    <div class="site-footer__brand">
      <Logo variant="horizontal" theme="dark" />
      <p>Abogados Paoletti &amp; Palau</p>
      <p class="site-footer__muted">Buenos Aires, Argentina</p>
    </div>

    <div class="site-footer__col">
      <h3>Contacto</h3>
      <p>
        <svg class="icon-inline" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><rect x="2" y="4" width="16" height="12" rx="1.5" /><path d="M3 5.5 10 11l7-5.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
        <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL_ESTUDIO}`}>{EMAIL_ESTUDIO}</a>
      </p>
      <p>
        <svg class="icon-inline" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" /><circle cx="17.2" cy="6.8" r="0.9" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" /></svg>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/estudiojapp/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@estudiojapp</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="site-footer__col">
      <h3>Gisele Paoletti</h3>
      <p>
        <svg class="icon-inline" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><rect x="2" y="4" width="16" height="12" rx="1.5" /><path d="M3 5.5 10 11l7-5.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
        <a href={`mailto:${SOCIOS.gisele.email}`}>{SOCIOS.gisele.email}</a>
      </p>
      <p>{SOCIOS.gisele.numeroVisible}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="site-footer__col">
      <h3>Diego Palau</h3>
      <p>
        <svg class="icon-inline" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><rect x="2" y="4" width="16" height="12" rx="1.5" /><path d="M3 5.5 10 11l7-5.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
        <a href={`mailto:${SOCIOS.diego.email}`}>{SOCIOS.diego.email}</a>
      </p>
      <p>{SOCIOS.diego.numeroVisible}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="site-footer__col">
      <h3>Mapa del sitio</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/el-estudio/">El estudio</a></li>
        <li><a href="/equipo/">Equipo</a></li>
        <li><a href="/empresas/">Empresas</a></li>
        <li><a href="/personas/">Personas</a></li>
        <li><a href="/propiedad-intelectual/">Propiedad Intelectual</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contacto/">Contacto</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container site-footer__bottom">
    <p class="site-footer__legal">
      El envío de una consulta no implica aceptación del caso ni genera relación abogado-cliente
      hasta su confirmación expresa por el estudio.
    </p>
    <p class="site-footer__copy">
      <span>© {year} Estudio Jurídico APP</span>
      <a href="#top">Volver arriba ↑</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    background: var(--bg-dark);
    color: var(--text-on-dark-muted);
    padding-top: 3.5rem;
  }
  .site-footer__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(244, 239, 234, 0.12);
  }
  .site-footer__brand p {
    margin: 0.9rem 0 0.15rem;
    color: var(--color-cream);
  }
  .site-footer__muted {
    color: var(--text-on-dark-muted) !important;
  }
  .site-footer h3 {
    color: var(--color-gold);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }
  .site-footer p {
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
  .site-footer a {
    color: var(--color-cream);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .site-footer a:hover {
    color: var(--color-gold);
  }
  .icon-inline {
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: -2px;
    margin-right: 0.3rem;
    color: var(--color-gold);
  }
  .site-footer ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .site-footer__bottom {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding-block: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .site-footer__legal {
    max-width: 46ch;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-on-dark-muted);
  }
  .site-footer__copy {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .site-footer__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
    .site-footer__brand {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .site-footer__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
